<title>FINLAND: Finnish raw wood prices rise further in Oct - METLA.</title>
<headline>Finnish raw wood prices rise further in Oct - METLA.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish raw wood stumpage prices rose in October (weeks 41-44), building on their rises in August and September, the Finnish Forest Research Institute METLA said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Pulpwood stumpage prices (markka per cubic metre):</p>
<p>	     Oct '96   Sept '96     1995	H2 '95	H1 '95</p>
<p> Pine	  95.90	95.40    93.00	 93.20	 92.90</p>
<p> Spruce     123.30     123.00   109.70	109.00	110.20</p>
<p> Birch	 93.00	92.20    98.20	 98.00	 98.40 @</p>
<p>Logwood stumpage prices (markka per cubic metre):</p>
<p>	     Oct '96   Sept '96     1995	 H2 '95     H1 '95</p>
<p> Pine	 245.50     243.80   247.10	 244.60     249.30</p>
<p> Spruce     203.60     203.20   197.60	 192.40     201.00</p>
<p> Birch	245.40     242.90   244.10	 240.70     246.70</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 235</p>
</text>
